{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1522133-oh-no","id":1522133,"title":"Oh No!!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-09-05T20:08:37-07:00","id":1522133,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon4.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Oh No!!","content":"So I was scrolling through my PDF copy of the Mage Storyteller's Handbook (from DrivethruRPG), and I noticed that it's missing pages 152 and 153. Is there any way anyone can get me those two missing pages?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28074-doktor-von-zwitter","name":"Doktor von Zwitter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28074_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T02:05:00-07:00","id":1522145,"title":"","content":"Looks like at some point the White Wolf account rolled back the file. The present copy on DriveThru looks like a (not very good) scan of the original book with the original early 2000s adverts at the end.<br /> <br /> The file used to be a really nice sharp digital copy... with the adverts replaced with one for 2011 era Onyx Path. So, maybe that's the reason.<br /> <br /> I will say, you're not hugely missing out.<br /> <br /> 152 is<ul><li>A lot of mages like the Enlightenment.</li> <li>Hermetics and Choristers compete with the Order of Reason for converts in the court of Louis XIV, as well as other absolute monarchs.</li> <li>The Order of Reason is somewhat split by their attitudes towards divine monarchy and the state.</li> <li>A lot of OoR members thinks that Deism is cool. The Cabal of Pure Thought disagree.</li> <li>1 paragraph explaining the fall of the Craftmasons over the century 1650-1750. The High Guild goes to war with them, whilst the rest of the Order ignores it. The Guild buys Artificer and Gabrielite mercenaries to tip the balance.</li> <li>Golden Age of piracy has mages in it.</li> </ul>153<ul><li>A large sidebar on whether the Craftmasons are actually gone. (Not nearly as interesting as that sounds, as there's little detail on any options, and they're all fairly obvious).</li> <li>A description of early industrial revolution.</li> <li>A description of Romanticism.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T02:30:07-07:00","id":1522146,"title":"","content":"If you had discord, pm me your discord handle and I can help you out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},